## Current triage

Deduplicate report IDs before counting, then resolve the tenant's locale, form,
and report channel. Browser-derived intake tags are clues, not cause labels.
Read the timeline as received versus merged: a merge spike does not establish
when the problem started.

Use [decision 0002](/kb/decisions/0002-dedupe-by-cause) and the
[current triage rule](/kb/triage/dedupe). The old subject-only rule is superseded.
